      "F17": "Diffuse lymphadenopathy is highly suggestive of lymphoma, making it a strong supporting fact for this diagnosis.",
      "F18": "A large mesenteric mass abutting multiple segments of small intestine and encasing the mesenteric vasculature is highly suggestive of lymphoma, but could also contribute to ischemia."
